<Layout title="Mind the Marbles" current="Blog">
  <section class="page prose">
    <div class="pagehead"><h2>🧠 Mind the Marbles</h2><span>Observations for people whose brains won’t sit still.</span></div>
    <p>Mind the Marbles is a recurring column on Local Buzz ATX. Think of a stand-up set that happens to run in a newspaper: small, specific moments, a little overthinking, and the “is it just me?” stuff everybody has and nobody mentions.</p>
    <h3>What you’ll find here</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Short, funny, first-person observations about how we think and why we do what we do.</li>
      <li>Everyday absurdities, the 2 a.m. thoughts, and the arguments we win in the shower.</li>
      <li>A column you can read in a couple of minutes, then send to the friend who needs it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>It’s humor and reflection, not news and not advice. If you’re struggling, the <a href="/resources">Community Resources</a> page lists places that can help.</p>
    <h3>Latest column</h3>
    <p>The first column is on its way. In the meantime, get the <a href="/morning-buzz">Weekly Buzz newsletter</a>.</p>
    <AdRow />
  </section>
</Layout>
